d","DirectX Compatible Sound Card"]],"deck":2,"blurb":"The year is 2036, twenty-five years after nuclear war, and Artyom must leave the wrecked Moscow Metro behind. Metro Exodus is a first-person shooter that sends him by train across the Russian wilderness after the apocalypse, with a story that spans a full year.\n\nLevels are larger and less linear than before, with survival elements and room for sandbox-style exploration. Resources are scarce and the world is hostile, so careful play matters. Owners of the game are also entitled to an enhanced PC version with upgraded visuals. 4A Games developed it. It is single-player with full controller support, and suits players who like story-led shooters with survival pressure."}}